cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Training Data Barriers and Mitigation Strategies in Weed Detection, Classification, and Segmentation: A Systematic Review and Quantitative Synthesis"
abstract: >-
  Statistical analysis and reproducibility materials for a systematic review
  and quantitative synthesis of training-data barriers and mitigation
  strategies in weed detection, classification, and segmentation. The
  repository includes the analysis-ready record of 199 included studies and
  the scripts that build the tables, statistics, and figures.
type: software
authors:
